  "project_description": "Drupal 8 and up Module for managing site modals.\n\nMaintained and supported by\n\n Interactive Knowledge .\n\n This module creates a custom entity (Modal) and allows for different bundles. All are fieldable and provide template suggestions for each bundle type.\n\n Requirements\n \n \n Block module \n Address Module \n \n APIs supported \n \n GeoIP2 PHP Library (included in module) \n ipdata (requires API key from ipdata.co ) \n AbstractAPI Geolocation API (requires API key from abstractapi.com ) \n \n Installation & Configuration\n \n Install via composer (required) . See Using Composer to install Drupal for more information. \n\n How to install and configure the Modal Management Module \n\n Back to top",
